node_modules
# Docker matches a bare pattern only at the context ROOT, so the line above does
# NOT cover scripts/audit/node_modules — the measurement harness's dependency
# island, which carries playwright and its ~200MB browser payload. Without this
# it would be shipped into the build context and the image.
**/node_modules
.next
.git
data
**/__pycache__
*.log
*.tmp
.env
.env.local
.env.development
scripts/_*.json
scripts/_*.log
scripts/_*.py
# ⚠️ `scraper/**` (not a bare `scraper`) so the two INE gazetteer CSVs below can
# be re-included. A bare `scraper` excludes the DIRECTORY itself, and Docker
# cannot re-include a child of an excluded directory — which is exactly how the
# gazetteer went missing from the app image (wave185): the mint sweep runs
# INSIDE the app container and read `scraper/config/ine_municipalities.csv`
# relative to cwd, so every row failed ENOENT and nothing could be minted.
#
# Only the two CSVs ship — NOT the rest of scraper/config/, which is Python
# settings/config that the Next app has no business carrying.
scraper/**
!scraper/config/ine_municipalities.csv
!scraper/config/ine_municipalities_coofficial.csv
docs
*.md
!FORGE_PLAN.md
# /noticias content must reach the build image (root *.md above only
# matches root-level files, but keep this explicit + future-proof)
!content/noticias/*.md
